cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software/benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Copy What You See, Forget What You Know: Turkish Caret Orthography as a Surface-Form Priming Probe for Free-Tier LLMs"
abstract: >-
  A rule-verifiable, judge-free evaluation of Turkish orthography fidelity in
  free-tier LLMs. Headline result: models drop TDK-required carets in 61.1% of
  occurrences under unprimed elicitation but reproduce them when primed.
  Companion benchmark: https://github.com/oguzcura/tr-mmlu-ecosystem-audit
authors:
